PROTEIN DOMAIN ABBREVIATIONS :

AP: Aspartic protease
ATF: Aphid transmission factor
CGIN: Undescribed conserved module present in CGIN1 integrases
CHR: Chromodomain
dUTPase: Deoxyuridine triphosphate nucleotidohydrolase
ENV: Envelope
GAG: Gag protein
GAGCOAT: Caulimoviridae coat protein equivalent to GAG
INT: Integrase (Note that GIN/GINGER integrases are also included here)
KRAB-A: Krüppel-associated box domain identified in KRBA2 integrases 
MOV: Movement protein
NYN: Ribonuclease NYN domain present in CGIN1 integrases 
ORF1_Nterdomain: second nonpol protease domain
PR_OTU: Additional Ovarian tumor cysteine protease domain identifiable in GINGER1 transposons 
PR_ULP1: Additional ULP1 protease catalytic domain identifiable in GINA, GINNY and GINNO transposons
RNaseH: Ribonuclease H
RT: Reverse Transcriptase
SCAN-A2: SCAN domain ifentified in SCAND3 integrases 
TAV: Transactivator/viroplasmin protein
VAP: Virion-associated protein

